# Sunspine Lynx: "Players can't gain life" (CR 119.7). On turn 1, under the Lynx, Ajani Resolute's 0 ("You gain 1 life") still
# resolves, but Bot1 gains nothing (the ruling), and with no life gained there is no life gain event, so "Whenever you gain life,
# put a loyalty counter on Ajani" doesn't trigger (CR 119.9): Ajani stays at 2. (The control, where both happen:
# ajani-resolute-gains-a-loyalty-counter-for-each-life-gain-of-his-controller-only.) Paying life is not gaining it (CR 119.4):
# on turn 2 Bot2 pays 1 life for Mana Confluence's mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Sunspine Lynx
Mox Pearl
Ajani Resolute
Plains
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mana Confluence
Island x26

